{"id":"when-the-world-falls-away","v":1,"lines":[{"t0":27.73,"t1":30.78,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"I've walked through cities made of stone,","w":[[27.73,28.15],[28.15,28.74],[28.74,28.88],[28.88,29.66],[29.66,29.92],[29.92,30.22],[30.22,30.76]]},{"t0":30.78,"t1":34.28,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"I've heard a thousand voices call.","w":[[30.78,32.1],[32.1,32.3],[32.3,32.46],[32.46,32.98],[32.98,33.68],[33.68,34.26]]},{"t0":34.28,"t1":38.12,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"I've chased the things I thought I needed,","w":[[34.28,35.64],[35.64,35.84],[35.84,36.08],[36.08,36.48],[36.48,36.76],[36.76,37.1],[37.1,37.52],[37.52,38.1]]},{"t0":38.12,"t1":41.96,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"Just to watch them disappear like smoke.","w":[[38.12,39],[39,39.24],[39.24,39.46],[39.46,39.72],[39.72,40.4],[40.4,41.14],[41.14,41.94]]},{"t0":41.96,"t1":46.32,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"And in the silence of the evening,","w":[[41.96,42.94],[42.94,43.08],[43.08,43.24],[43.24,43.86],[43.86,44.44],[44.44,44.74],[44.74,45.9]]},{"t0":46.32,"t1":49.48,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"When every road has lost its name,","w":[[46.32,46.46],[46.46,46.86],[46.86,47.28],[47.28,47.62],[47.62,47.86],[47.86,48.2],[48.2,48.86]]},{"t0":49.48,"t1":53.44,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"I find a truth I can't explain,","w":[[49.48,49.56],[49.56,50.03],[50.03,50.22],[50.22,51.06],[51.06,51.18],[51.18,51.74],[51.74,52.24]]},{"t0":53.52,"t1":57.56,"sec":"Verse 1","text":"A little light that still remains.","w":[[53.52,53.66],[53.66,54.08],[54.08,54.5],[54.5,54.74],[54.74,55.16],[55.16,56.36]]},{"t0":71.76,"t1":75.6,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"The years can change the face of everything,","w":[[71.76,72.1],[72.1,72.5],[72.5,72.76],[72.76,73.28],[73.28,73.64],[73.64,74.46],[74.46,74.68],[74.68,75.58]]},{"t0":75.6,"t1":79.32,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"The strongest walls can turn to dust.","w":[[75.6,76.56],[76.56,77.14],[77.14,77.62],[77.62,78],[78,78.5],[78.5,78.86],[78.86,79.3]]},{"t0":79.32,"t1":83.34,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"The words we swear, the dreams we carry,","w":[[79.32,79.74],[79.74,80.32],[80.32,80.68],[80.68,81.02],[81.02,81.52],[81.52,82],[82,82.34],[82.34,83.32]]},{"t0":83.34,"t1":87.1,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"All are fragile things we learn to trust.","w":[[83.34,83.79],[83.79,84.24],[84.24,84.58],[84.58,85.14],[85.14,85.38],[85.38,85.82],[85.82,86.02],[86.02,87.08]]},{"t0":87.1,"t1":90.58,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"But there's a place beyond the noise,","w":[[87.1,87.82],[87.82,88.18],[88.18,88.26],[88.26,88.62],[88.62,89.34],[89.34,89.64],[89.64,90.56]]},{"t0":90.58,"t1":94.2,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"Beyond the fear of being wrong.","w":[[90.58,91.62],[91.62,91.88],[91.88,92.24],[92.24,92.68],[92.68,92.98],[92.98,94.18]]},{"t0":94.2,"t1":98.5,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"Where I don't have to hide my shadows,","w":[[94.2,95.06],[95.06,95.32],[95.32,95.52],[95.52,95.82],[95.82,96.14],[96.14,96.48],[96.48,96.92],[96.92,97.7]]},{"t0":98.5,"t1":101.84,"sec":"Verse 2","text":"Where I remember I belong.","w":[[98.5,98.68],[98.68,98.9],[98.9,99.28],[99.28,100.26],[100.26,100.64]]},{"t0":102.24,"t1":105.6,"sec":"Chorus","text":"When the world falls away,","w":[[102.24,102.48],[102.48,102.68],[102.68,103.08],[103.08,103.8],[103.8,104.5]]},{"t0":105.6,"t1":108.4,"sec":"Chorus","text":"When the night swallows the day,","w":[[105.6,106.02],[106.02,106.22],[106.22,106.56],[106.56,107.14],[107.14,107.62],[107.62,108.38]]},{"t0":108.4,"t1":112.12,"sec":"Chorus","text":"I'll hold on to what is real,","w":[[108.4,109.44],[109.44,109.9],[109.9,110.18],[110.18,110.54],[110.54,110.9],[110.9,111.22],[111.22,112.1]]},{"t0":112.12,"t1":115.66,"sec":"Chorus","text":"To the things I know and feel.","w":[[112.12,112.98],[112.98,113.16],[113.16,113.6],[113.6,113.94],[113.94,114.48],[114.48,114.92],[114.92,115.64]]},{"t0":115.66,"t1":119.46,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Let the thunder shake the sky,","w":[[115.66,116.56],[116.56,116.78],[116.78,117.2],[117.2,118],[118,118.32],[118.32,119.44]]},{"t0":119.46,"t1":122.98,"sec":"Chorus","text":"Let the old roads pass me by.","w":[[119.46,120.16],[120.16,120.44],[120.44,120.72],[120.72,121.24],[121.24,121.69],[121.69,121.96],[121.96,122.96]]},{"t0":122.98,"t1":126.22,"sec":"Chorus","text":"When there's nothing left to prove,","w":[[122.98,123.7],[123.7,124.12],[124.12,124.62],[124.62,125.16],[125.16,125.52],[125.52,126.2]]},{"t0":126.22,"t1":131.08,"sec":"Chorus","text":"I'll remember what is true.","w":[[126.22,127.56],[127.56,128.3],[128.3,128.7],[128.7,129.04],[129.04,129.88]]},{"t0":187.2,"t1":190.76,"sec":"Verse 3","text":"I've seen the brave become the broken,","w":[[187.2,187.62],[187.62,188.04],[188.04,188.56],[188.56,189],[189,189.58],[189.58,189.96],[189.96,190.74]]},{"t0":190.76,"t1":194.42,"sec":"Verse 3","text":"I've watched the proud forget their names.","w":[[190.76,191.42],[191.42,191.76],[191.76,191.96],[191.96,192.42],[192.42,193.04],[193.04,193.5],[193.5,194.4]]},{"t0":194.42,"t1":198,"sec":"Verse 3","text":"We build our lives on little moments,","w":[[194.42,194.68],[194.68,195.04],[195.04,195.42],[195.42,196.16],[196.16,196.56],[196.56,197.08],[197.08,197.94]]},{"t0":198,"t1":201.44,"sec":"Verse 3","text":"Then wonder why they never stay.","w":[[198,198.42],[198.42,198.84],[198.84,199.52],[199.52,200.02],[200.02,200.58],[200.58,201.42]]},{"t0":201.44,"t1":205.88,"sec":"Verse 3","text":"So let the future come unanswered,","w":[[201.44,201.98],[201.98,202.3],[202.3,202.66],[202.66,203.2],[203.2,203.96],[203.96,205.72]]},{"t0":205.88,"t1":209.02,"sec":"Verse 3","text":"Let the past become the past.","w":[[205.88,206],[206,206.22],[206.22,206.72],[206.72,207.32],[207.32,207.78],[207.78,208.56]]},{"t0":209.02,"t1":212.68,"sec":"Verse 3","text":"I don't need a world that lasts forever,","w":[[209.02,209.24],[209.24,209.56],[209.56,209.82],[209.82,210],[210,210.32],[210.32,210.68],[210.68,211.08],[211.08,211.48]]},{"t0":212.94,"t1":217.82,"sec":"Verse 3","text":"I just need a truth that lasts.","w":[[212.94,213.16],[213.16,213.4],[213.4,214.02],[214.02,214.24],[214.24,214.5],[214.5,215],[215,216.62]]},{"t0":228.29,"t1":232.62,"sec":"Bridge","text":"If all the lights go out tomorrow,","w":[[228.29,228.54],[228.54,228.74],[228.74,228.9],[228.9,229.22],[229.22,229.66],[229.66,230.54],[230.54,231.64]]},{"t0":232.62,"t1":236.02,"sec":"Bridge","text":"If every promise disappears,","w":[[232.62,233.06],[233.06,233.38],[233.38,233.88],[233.88,235.02]]},{"t0":236.02,"t1":238.92,"sec":"Bridge","text":"Will we remember who we were","w":[[236.02,236.12],[236.12,236.36],[236.36,236.92],[236.92,237.52],[237.52,238.32],[238.32,238.74]]},{"t0":238.92,"t1":243.1,"sec":"Bridge","text":"Before we learned to live in fear?","fb":1},{"t0":244.24,"t1":248.18,"sec":"Build","text":"I won't surrender to the silence!","w":[[244.24,244.41],[244.41,244.92],[244.92,245.76],[245.76,246.84],[246.84,247.26],[247.26,248.16]]},{"t0":248.18,"t1":251.82,"sec":"Build","text":"I won't be buried in the noise!","w":[[248.18,249.12],[249.12,249.41],[249.41,249.56],[249.56,250],[250,250.6],[250.6,250.84],[250.84,251.8]]},{"t0":251.82,"t1":255.28,"sec":"Build","text":"Through every storm, through every ending,","w":[[251.82,252.2],[252.2,252.58],[252.58,253],[253,253.98],[253.98,254.42],[254.42,255.24]]},{"t0":255.28,"t1":259.9,"sec":"Build","text":"I'll choose the things that have a voice!","w":[[255.28,255.72],[255.72,256.08],[256.08,256.4],[256.4,256.92],[256.92,257.34],[257.34,257.76],[257.76,257.93],[257.93,258.7]]},{"t0":266.43,"t1":270.42,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"When the world falls away,","w":[[266.43,266.86],[266.86,267.19],[267.19,267.7],[267.7,268.24],[268.24,269.22]]},{"t0":271.14,"t1":272.82,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"When the night swallows the day,","w":[[271.14,271.56],[271.56,271.65],[271.65,271.78],[271.78,271.97],[271.97,272.06],[272.06,272.8]]},{"t0":272.82,"t1":276.32,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"I'll hold on to what is real,","w":[[272.82,273.8],[273.8,274.3],[274.3,274.6],[274.6,274.9],[274.9,275.32],[275.32,275.66],[275.66,276.3]]},{"t0":276.32,"t1":280.2,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"To the things I know and feel.","w":[[276.32,277.36],[277.36,277.58],[277.58,278],[278,278.36],[278.36,278.8],[278.8,279.32],[279.32,280.18]]},{"t0":280.2,"t1":283.88,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"Let the thunder shake the sky,","w":[[280.2,280.9],[280.9,281.1],[281.1,281.52],[281.52,282.28],[282.28,282.64],[282.64,283.86]]},{"t0":283.88,"t1":287.34,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"Let the old roads pass me by.","w":[[283.88,284.44],[284.44,284.76],[284.76,285.01],[285.01,285.38],[285.38,285.9],[285.9,286.38],[286.38,287.32]]},{"t0":287.34,"t1":290.36,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"When there's nothing left to prove,","w":[[287.34,287.94],[287.94,288.34],[288.34,288.86],[288.86,289.42],[289.42,289.74],[289.74,290.34]]},{"t0":290.36,"t1":295.42,"sec":"Final Chorus","text":"I'll remember what is true.","w":[[290.36,291.72],[291.72,292.16],[292.16,292.88],[292.88,293.2],[293.2,294.22]]},{"t0":298.46,"t1":302.66,"sec":"Outro","text":"When the world falls away...","w":[[298.46,298.88],[298.88,299.1],[299.1,299.82],[299.82,300.7],[300.7,301.46]]},{"t0":305.5,"t1":310.62,"sec":"Outro","text":"When there's nothing left to say...","w":[[305.5,305.92],[305.92,306.28],[306.28,306.82],[306.82,307.76],[307.76,308.62],[308.62,309.42]]},{"t0":311.04,"t1":315.16,"sec":"Outro","text":"I'll remember...","fb":1},{"t0":322,"t1":324.84,"sec":"Outro","text":"What is true.","w":[[322,322.42],[322.42,322.7],[322.7,323.64]]}],"gloss":[{"w":"fall away","m":{"en":"to disappear or become less and less until it is gone","tr":"yok olup gitmek, dağılıp gitmek","fa":"فرو ریختن، از بین رفتن","es":"desvanecerse, desmoronarse"},"at":[[16,"falls away"],[40,"falls away"],[48,"falls away"]]},{"w":"fragile","m":{"en":"easy to break or damage","tr":"kırılgan","fa":"شکننده","es":"frágil"},"at":[[11,"fragile"]]},{"w":"hold on to","m":{"en":"to keep something and not let it go","tr":"sımsıkı tutunmak","fa":"محکم چسبیدن به، نگه داشتن","es":"aferrarse a"},"at":[[18,"hold on to"],[42,"hold on to"]]},{"w":"nothing left to prove","m":{"en":"you do not need to show anyone that you are good enough any more","tr":"kanıtlayacak bir şeyi kalmamak","fa":"دیگه چیزی برای ثابت کردن نداشتن","es":"no tener nada que demostrar"},"at":[[22,"nothing left to prove"],[46,"nothing left to prove"]]},{"w":"surrender","m":{"en":"to stop fighting and accept that you have lost","tr":"teslim olmak","fa":"تسلیم شدن","es":"rendirse"},"at":[[36,"surrender"]]},{"w":"buried","m":{"en":"put under the ground; hidden under a lot of something","tr":"gömülmüş","fa":"دفن‌شده، زیرِ چیزی مدفون","es":"enterrado"},"at":[[37,"buried"]]}]}